      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MONROE (1) was a big winner two back scoring by 1.75 lengths then got further back last time but came home hard into second and beaten a nose at this track (22.79). The form from her last run stacks up well. Good form should continue. LOCHINVAR GRACE (2) is a progressive type who recorded her 14th career win last time out (22.78) at this track. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Expected to measure up again. SEMI PEAKIN' (8) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his exceptional win the start prior, getting around this track over 400m in 22.71. Should be in this for a long way. BARRAMUNDI LOU (3) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 0.8 lengths second (23.07) in a Grade 4 at this track.",
